### 2. Update GraphExecutor for Bidirectional Flow

#### [MODIFY] [src/core/graph.rs](file:///home/ruffsl/git/ruffsl/CtrlAssist/src/core/graph.rs)

- Add `tick_all()` method that calls [tick()](file:///home/ruffsl/git/ruffsl/CtrlAssist/src/core/node.rs#114-119) on all nodes (for SourceNode/SinkNode polling)
- Support bidirectional edges (FF flows opposite direction)
- Handle events emitted by [tick()](file:///home/ruffsl/git/ruffsl/CtrlAssist/src/core/node.rs#114-119) as well as [process()](file:///home/ruffsl/git/ruffsl/CtrlAssist/src/core/graph.rs#166-231)

