### 4. Port Definitions Update

#### [MODIFY] [src/core/node.rs](file:///home/ruffsl/git/ruffsl/CtrlAssist/src/core/node.rs)

Add bidirectional port constants:

```rust
pub mod ports {
    // Source ports
    pub const SOURCE_OUTPUT: PortId = PortId(0);    // Input events out
    pub const SOURCE_FF_IN: PortId = PortId(1);     // FF events in
    
    // Mux ports  
    pub const MUX_PRIMARY_IN: PortId = PortId(0);
    pub const MUX_ASSIST_IN: PortId = PortId(1);
    pub const MUX_OUTPUT: PortId = PortId(2);
    pub const MUX_FF_IN: PortId = PortId(3);        // FF from sink
    
    // Sink ports
    pub const SINK_INPUT: PortId = PortId(0);       // Input events in
    pub const SINK_FF_OUT: PortId = PortId(1);      // FF events out
}
```

