## Verification Plan

### Unit Tests
- `SourceNode` emits events on tick, handles FF input
- `SinkNode` writes events on process, emits FF on tick
- [MuxNode](file:///home/ruffsl/git/ruffsl/CtrlAssist/src/core/nodes/mux.rs#36-41) routes FF correctly per mode
- `GraphExecutor.tick_all()` processes all nodes

### Integration Test
- Build full graph with mock nodes
- Inject FF event at sink, verify it reaches correct source based on mode

### Manual Test
```bash
cargo run -- mux2 --mode toggle --primary 0 --assist 1
fftest /dev/input/eventXX  # Test rumble on both, verify only active rumbles
```

